        "@value": "in subparagraph 40(b), by substituting for the words “summons in chambers” the words “notice of application”. Savings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/41/eng@/~cl_5",
